    "directions": [
      "Core the apples and grate them.",
      "Heat ghee in a kadai on medium flame. Add apples and cook till they are soft, for about 6-7 mins.",
      "They will turn brown. Add milk and cook on low flame for 10mins, keep stirring.",
      "When the moisture is evaporated, add khoya and sugar cook for 5 mins.",
      "Add cinnamon powder, cook again for 2 mins.",
      "Add almonds and pistachios. Switch off the flame.",
      "Serve warm or cooled."
